WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.820
Why are wires made of copper with a plastic coat?

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:07.660
Copper lets electricity flow easily: a conductor.

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.500
Plastic stops it: an insulator.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.016
Each material is chosen for its job.
